==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|складъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*sъkladъ}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*sъ(n)|*sъ(n)-}} and {{m|sla-pro|*klasti}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-склад.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-склад.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|at|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|a,c|склад|pltail=*|notes=* in the obsolete sense "syllable" and, in slang and vernacular speech, the sense "warehouse"|dim=скла́дик|adj=складско́й}}

# [[supply]], [[stock]]
# [[warehouse]], [[depot]]
# {{lb|ru|military}} [[dump]]
#: {{coi|ru|'''скла́д''' боеприпа́сов|ammunition '''dump'''}}
# [[way]], [[manner]]
#: {{coi|ru|'''склад''' [[жи́зни]]|'''way''' of life}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''склад''' [[ума́]]|mindset, mentality|lit='''manner''' of mind}}
# [[build]], [[body]] [[type]], [[physique]]
# {{lb|ru|obsolete|except|in fixed expressions}} [[syllable]] {{q|in this sense, the plurals have the endings accented, as in the non-nominative/accusative plurals of {{m|ru|слог|t=syllable}}}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[чита́ть]] [[по]] '''склада́м'''|lit=to read by '''syllables'''|to read haltingly, to read ineptly}}
# {{lb|ru|music|informal}} [[harmony]]

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|a,c|склад|par=+1|notes=1 Only in the expression {{m|ru|ни скла́ду ни ла́ду||without rhyme or reason}}.|pltail=*|notes2=* In the obsolete sense "syllable" and, in slang and vernacular speech, the sense "warehouse".}}

